Package: YACT
Title: Yet Anothr Cleaning Template for IMPACT Initiatives
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iyed", "Ghedamsi", , "iyed.ghedamsi@impact-initiatives.org", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("IMPACT Initiatives", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Provides an end-to-end pipeline for processing survey data,
  specifically designed for data and analysis staff within IMPACT Initiatives.
  This package utilizes the 'targets' framework to orchestrate and integrate
  various data cleaning, composition, and analysis tools that are currently
  available across different R packages developed by IMPACT. Its aim is to
  streamline and standardize the workflow from raw survey data to analytical
  outputs.
